# BuildCommand AI 1.2.3 - Menu Behavior Hardening
#
# Hardens the corrected native <details> menu behavior from 1.2.2:
# - one open dropdown at a time
# - click-away closes
# - destination click closes
# - Escape closes
# - window blur closes
# - navigation/pages/features remain unchanged
